  "command_construction": "Load runtime_card_toml once with --read-only-state --no-save-state. Apply model_command. Before each row apply reset_command, then merge base_runtime_overrides with runtime_modes[mode].runtime_overrides and set each key to compact JSON. Inspect parent_momenta_GeV flattened in stored order, formatted through .17g then Decimal fixed notation; add -f iff force_arb. Use --json-output point--mode.json. Full reset before every case is required.",
  "scope": "Targets are historical threshold energy offsets, not measured native radial-root gaps or soft radii. Norm checking returns primary, componentwise checking returns a rotation average, while cut events remain primary. All arithmetic uses the pinned binary's compiled1000-bit Arb type; tolerances do not change its bit count. The exact coincidence has no defined reference in the separate-residue representation."
